// ═══ STAGE 5: the typed AST store. ty[base(file) + node] in the flat array mx after the witnesses; the log of the nodes of the def in
// progress after the column; the file bases (the running node count) after the log ═══
// columns, each cTyN words: ty (ground type id), ce (the callee / case / handler / op symbol), ax (call of a generic def: its mono site + 1;
// ctor or pattern: the case tag + 1); a node is a call or a case use, never both
def Typer.moTy(s: Typer.S, k: I64): I64 = Typer.moWit(s, 2 * Typer.wcap()) + k
